The snake
Look. Low-poly like the reference: a body of 7 triangle-and-quad segments that follow the head like a chain, coral #D85A30 with darker facets #A63D1F, thin dark outline, two small fang triangles that flash white when it is about to spit. Hitbox on the head and the first body segments: 36×16 px.
